  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen capacity of local CSOs to become actors of good governance through third party grants.The project aims to strengthen the EU and its Member State guiding values and principles &quot;to promote civil society space and enhance their support for building capacity of civil society organisations (CSOs), so as to strengthen their voice in the development process and to advance political, social and economic dialogue&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
